# Environment files.
#
# `.env` and `.env.example` are committed deliberately and hold only public,
# browser-safe values — the Supabase URL, project id and publishable key.
# Every other variant may hold a service-role key or an API key, and `*.local`
# above only covers `.env.local`; `.env.production` and `.env.development` were
# not matched by anything.
.env.*
!.env.example

